Interface symbols font for the browser build
============================================

assets/fonts/ReShikiKeys.ttf is a subset of DejaVu Sans 2.37
(dejavu-fonts-ttf-2.37/ttf/DejaVuSans.ttf, SHA-256
7da195a74c55bef988d0d48f9508bd5d849425c1770dba5d7bfc6ce9ed848954;
https://github.com/dejavu-fonts/dejavu-fonts/releases/tag/version_2_37)
holding only the space, the plus and the symbols the interface draws that
Liberation Sans lacks: the macOS key symbols ⌘ ⇧ ⌥ ⌃ ⌫ ↩ ↵, the arrows
↗ ↶ ↷ ↺, the disclosures ⌄ ▴ ▸ ▾ ◂ ▶ △ ◢, ★ ☆ ✓ and ⠿. The full-width
plus ＋ maps to the plus. scripts/subset_keys_font.py makes it with fontTools'
subsetter, without hinting or layout tables. As the license requires for a
modified font, it is renamed ReShiki Keys; its copyright and license name
records are kept.

